  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-swirling-blue.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Cost: 1 Sorcery Point</p></blockquote><p>When you cast a spell, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to cast it without any Verbal, Somatic, or Material components, except Material components that are consumed by the spell or that have a cost specified in the spell.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: Use this feature and pick the spell; it is cast without Verbal and Somatic components, and without Material ones that are neither consumed nor costed. With Sorcery Incarnate and Innate Sorcery active you are offered a second option. Sorcery Points come from Font of Magic (from a Metamagic Adept feat first, if the creature has one).</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
